# passes/seaexpand/build.list -- what make adds to the pass's own passes/seaexpand/*.bas (DESIGN.md 2.6.3).
#   lib <module>...   shared modules of passes/lib/ (io diag tables limb f64emu fltlit)
#   data <block>...   generated DATA blocks (errors errno exits consts entries records)
# The build concatenates the parts in the canonical order of DESIGN.md 2.6.3 whatever the
# order written here; a name outside the two sets is a build error.
lib io diag tables limb f64emu
data errors exits consts records
